  "historyNote": "#2234, eff 1-1-83; ss by #2930, eff 12-21-84, EXPIRED: 12-21-90 New. #5150, eff 5-6-90; ss by #6504, INTERIM, eff 5-5-97, EXPIRED: 9-2-97; ss by #6566, eff 9-2-97; ss by #7253, eff 4-30-00; amd by #7993, eff 11-26-03; ss by #8157, eff 9-5-04; ss by #9359, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 1-9-09, EXPIRED: 7-8-09 New. #9529, eff 8-17-09; ss by #12480, INTERIM, eff 2-16-18, EXPIRES: 8-15-18; ss by #12589, eff 7-23-18",
